			<div class="content" id="post-content-729217">
									

<p>a little better but still lacks a hook. a crapload of unknown matter appears mysteriously and is swiftly destroyed. something to keep away from public knowledge so uncomfortable questions dont get asked, but not any kind of apparent threat at this time.</p>
<p>the only real concern comes from humanity's advancing technology and the potential for people to one day not only know about this but to go and try to examine it. is this material dangerous in some way? if it did not get destroyed in the lava flow on the moon's surface or if it were disturbed in some way would it become a threat? if not then it seems most likely to be an example of wormholes in action, a scientific curiosity but something that's impossible to properly contain and mostly insignificant outside of throwing certain theories into chaos while advancing others.</p>
<p>downvoted for now as it currently exists because if i were the Foundation i wouldnt try to actively keep this secret yet. i'll check back if it changes though, and upvote if it improves enough. i do like the initial concept and the directions it could be taken.</p>

