<p>Wormholes as garbage disposals, actually what they'd likely be used for by a race with the ability to generate them. Anything you can't recycle, you toss into a wormhole with the exit point above a black hole, star, or volcanic planetoid to be recycled cosmically. You'd need a monsterous amount of mass to appreciably alter whatever it is you're dumping into, and it lets you access the same dumping ground from potentially anywhere in the universe.</p>
<p>Oh, they'd be used for travel too, of course, but that's old hat.</p>
<p>It's occurred to me as well, that maybe this drop point is the other side of one or more of the SCPs the foundation chucks things into from time to time to see where they go.</p>

